    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/df5e4bc9-ba4f-4f2e-b2d4-e5c22f4ced7e-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 152px;\" /></p><p>Momentum of system remains conserved.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mi>&#969;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>M</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><msqrt><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p>",
